      "text": "Traffic Advisory – Isleville Street – Manhole Replacement\n\nFrom 8:00 AM to approximately 6:00 PM on Monday, November 3rd, Halifax Water crews will be on-site performing a manhole replacement at the intersection of Isleville Street and Bilby Street, Halifax.\n\nThe intersection will be closed. Traffic will be detoured.\n\nThis work will not impact Halifax Water services in the area.\n\nhttps://t.co/82y9XwFSvJ",
